  "notes": "Two unresolved conflicts are documented: (1) the general education page states 36 credit hours while its itemized components as published appear to total 38; (2) the catalog anchors PAOC and thesis-prospectus milestones to contract number while the academic calendar anchors them to semester number with different dates. Neither is reconciled. No B.A. residency-unit figure is published, so none is asserted. sha256 is null for every source. Each page was located and read at its public URL on 2026-08-31, but the network egress available during collection could not re-download raw response bodies for hashing, so no digest is asserted rather than a fabricated one. Agent 5 owns hashing via tools/fetch_sources.py; digests must be populated by that pipeline (or an equivalent unrestricted re-fetch) before this sidecar can pass a schema that requires 64 hex characters. retrieved_at reflects the collection session on 2026-08-31."
